completed_at: "2026-09-02T17:45:44.861Z"
author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: A publish inside a nested case in a later arm is refused; the same shape reached through else is refused; a binding made in the same arm that encloses a nested case still attests; a binding made before the block still attests; reverting the fix turns the fail-open guard red while the fail-closed guard stays green
risk: critical
severity: critical
repro_steps: Call auditPublishAttestation on a workflow whose case binds the flag in arm a and whose arm b opens a nested case containing npm publish with the variable expanded. Before the fix it returns failures empty.
component: attestation.ts
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
