close_reason: "Fixed by keying the sibling reset on the case depth before the segment. Verified by execution in both directions: the nested-case construction now returns one failure where it previously returned none, and reverting the condition turns the fail-open guard red while the fail-closed guard stays green. Full suite 417 passing, release:check green at 100 percent coverage."
